# Line-ending control (02-developer-tooling.md §37): LF everywhere, never CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never normalize.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
*.otf binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.mp3 binary
*.mp4 binary
*.sqlite binary
